        <mxCell id="c90" value="&lt;i&gt;Other source document types on 5010: SalesReturn (credits, cost relieved when goods come back) and JournalEntry (credits, the year-end closes, one a fiscal year). The reconciliation covers Shipment only.&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#8A5D00;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="334" width="824" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
