        <mxCell id="c97" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the Difference cells, which read zero for both quarters on both sides. The two blocks are the revenue and the cost half of the appendix table; the shaded note row names the source document types that also post to the cost account.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="414" width="860" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
